# ----- Claude Design handoff bundle (reference only — kept local, not committed) -----
.design-handoff/

# Local-only test tooling — the probes and the seed scripts.
# ⚑ `.local/` IS TRACKED (2026-09-03). It holds the probes and seed scripts, and
# leaving it out meant `tsc` never read them — a probe could import a function
# that no longer existed and stay "green" until someone ran it by hand. CI now
# typechecks it like anything else.
#
# ⚑ BEFORE ADDING ANYTHING HERE: this is a PUBLIC repo. No literal passwords, no
# keys. Both fixture passwords were moved to .env.local the day this was tracked;
# one of them had already been published from app/api/dev-login/route.ts.
# .env.local and .env*.local stay ignored above — do not touch those lines.
#
# ⚑ The SCRIPTS are tracked; their OUTPUT is not. Every *.json under .local is a
# run artifact — live mission and auth-user ids, rewritten on each run (_times.json
# alone is 150 kB). They are read with fs.readFileSync, never imported, so tsc does
# not need them, and committing them would publish live row ids and churn the diff
# on every probe run.
.local/**/*.json
